  'wp.reflect_mio': [P, 'Shiritori, the reflection (staged): you and Mio turn to each other. A hand to her chin (she hadn\'t thought about medicine once); put off, a nod; then a breath out (not the only one counting slips), an open hand (every shelf in her head) or her hands fidget (fun, and of no use: allowed?); her laugh at your win, a head shake at hers; a nod: a new rule of hers.', 'tests/e2e/staging_chapters.mjs --ch=misc (tests/e2e/staging_misc_cases.mjs; 4 branches: the endings, finding the word, playing together, not now)'],
  'wp.reflect_nao': [P, 'Shiritori, the reflection (staged): you and Nao turn to each other. Nao looks one way and the other (counting exits partway through the game); put off, a nod; then a nod (we were reading the same map), a hand to the satchel (same as deliveries) or a glance aside (somebody keeping up); a shrug at your win, an open hand at theirs.', 'tests/e2e/staging_chapters.mjs --ch=misc (tests/e2e/staging_misc_cases.mjs; 4 branches: the endings, finding the word, playing together, not now)'],
